/T (Corporate Social Responsibility \(CSR\) represents a business philosophy that extends beyond profit generation, emphasizing the ethical and socially responsible conduct of corporations was the genesis for the CSR act implemented in India since 2013. The underlying philosophy of CSR is rooted in the belief that businesses should not only pursue financial success but also contribute positively to the well-being of society and the environment.)
/E (Corporate Social Responsibility \(CSR\) represents a business philosophy that extends beyond profit generation, emphasizing the ethical and socially responsible conduct of corporations was the genesis for the CSR act implemented in India since 2013. The underlying philosophy of CSR is rooted in the belief that businesses should not only pursue financial success but also contribute positively to the well-being of society and the environment.)
