/S /H2
/T (Scope of Work: MRPL has constructed a stage, complete with civil and structural roofing works and floor tiling, to accommodate 3,000 to 5,000 people. The project is intended to support Kambala sports events and other cultural and community gatherings.)
/E (Scope of Work: MRPL has constructed a stage, complete with civil and structural roofing works and floor tiling, to accommodate 3,000 to 5,000 people. The project is intended to support Kambala sports events and other cultural and community gatherings.)
