783 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Relevance The construction of the stage is highly relevant to preserving and promoting local cultural heritage and sports like Kambala. These events are central to the community's identity and social cohesion in Dakshina Kannada. The facility not only supports large gatherings for cultural events but also serves as a venue for educational and social programs, aligning with.)
/E (Relevance The construction of the stage is highly relevant to preserving and promoting local cultural heritage and sports like Kambala. These events are central to the community's identity and social cohesion in Dakshina Kannada. The facility not only supports large gatherings for cultural events but also serves as a venue for educational and social programs, aligning with.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
784 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Effectiveness  The stage has effectively provided a physical space for cultural expression, contributing to the social fabric and reducing inequalities by providing equal opportunities for all community members to engage in cultural activities. Kambala sports events, in particular, are crucial to preserving Dakshina Kannada heritage, offering a platform for local talents to participate in traditional sports and for marginalized groups to engage in community events.)
/E (Effectiveness  The stage has effectively provided a physical space for cultural expression, contributing to the social fabric and reducing inequalities by providing equal opportunities for all community members to engage in cultural activities. Kambala sports events, in particular, are crucial to preserving Dakshina Kannada heritage, offering a platform for local talents to participate in traditional sports and for marginalized groups to engage in community events.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [7]
>>
