/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Most of the respondents were residents of Moodabidri for more than a decade and were familiar with facilities available in and around the village, and before the construction of the stage there were no facilities for Kambala sports events and local functions and this fund has provided and closed a huge gap. They opined that the facility is utilized very well and quite frequently, with a signification addition to participation from all.A good recall rate of being funded by MRPL is evident and the wish list for further support on this particular infra creation is Store room, Steel Railing, Dressing room, Lightings Wash room amongst the top 5, requirements.)
