814 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (The newly constructed stage for Koti Chennayya Kambalain, Moodabidre has become a vibrant center for cultural gatherings. With the capacity to host more than 3,000 attendees, the venue has revitalized local traditions, particularly the Kambala sports event, a unique buffalo race integral to Tulunadu culture. The annual Kambala festival attracted tourists from surrounding regions, boosting local businesses such as food vendors and craftspeople. This influx of visitors increased the economic activity in Moodabidre, supporting around 50 local entrepreneurs as shared by the villagers around the stage as shared by Ranjith Poojary , the manager at the mission. )
/E (The newly constructed stage for Koti Chennayya Kambalain, Moodabidre has become a vibrant center for cultural gatherings. With the capacity to host more than 3,000 attendees, the venue has revitalized local traditions, particularly the Kambala sports event, a unique buffalo race integral to Tulunadu culture. The annual Kambala festival attracted tourists from surrounding regions, boosting local businesses such as food vendors and craftspeople. This influx of visitors increased the economic activity in Moodabidre, supporting around 50 local entrepreneurs as shared by the villagers around the stage as shared by Ranjith Poojary , the manager at the mission. )
/Alt ()
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [2]
>>
