/S /H2
/T (Mr.Dhanraj one of the participant was very happy and said -Since the completion of the stage, the Moodabidre community has seen a significant increase in social events, from religious celebrations to cultural programs. Local organizations have started utilizing the space to host educational workshops and health camps, fostering a sense of unity. The stage has transformed into a gathering place, enhancing community bonds. Residents report improved relationships and collaboration among different community groups, illustrating the role of infrastructure in social cohesion.)
