934 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (The Women Rehabilitation Building at Prajna Counseling Centre aims to provide a safe haven for women facing domestic violence, mental health challenges, and social stigma in rural India. It serves as a critical resource for psychological support, vocational training, and community reintegration. The project is vital for promoting gender equality, empowering women, and fostering a supportive environment that recognizes and addresses women's issues in rural settings. In rural India, women often face a multitude of challenges stemming from deep-rooted socio-cultural norms, economic constraints, and inadequate access to resources. Issues such as domestic violence, mental health stigma, lack of educational opportunities, and limited access to vocational training are prevalent. These challenges hinder women's personal growth and contribute to a cycle of dependency and vulnerability.)
/E (The Women Rehabilitation Building at Prajna Counseling Centre aims to provide a safe haven for women facing domestic violence, mental health challenges, and social stigma in rural India. It serves as a critical resource for psychological support, vocational training, and community reintegration. The project is vital for promoting gender equality, empowering women, and fostering a supportive environment that recognizes and addresses women's issues in rural settings. In rural India, women often face a multitude of challenges stemming from deep-rooted socio-cultural norms, economic constraints, and inadequate access to resources. Issues such as domestic violence, mental health stigma, lack of educational opportunities, and limited access to vocational training are prevalent. These challenges hinder women's personal growth and contribute to a cycle of dependency and vulnerability.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 42 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
935 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (The Women Rehabilitation Building at Prajna Counseling Centre plays a pivotal role in providing a safe space for women escaping domestic violence. Project recognizes the importance of mental well-being and offers counseling services that address issues such as depression, anxiety, and trauma related to abuse. By providing professional mental health services, the centre helps de-stigmatize mental health issues and encourages women to seek help, fostering a culture of openness and support. The project includes vocational training programs aimed at equipping women with skills that enhance their employability and economic independence. By learning trades such as tailoring, handicrafts, and computer skills, women can generate their own income, thus reducing their dependence on abusive partners and family members. Economic empowerment is crucial for fostering self-reliance and improving the overall quality of life for women and their families.)
/E (The Women Rehabilitation Building at Prajna Counseling Centre plays a pivotal role in providing a safe space for women escaping domestic violence. Project recognizes the importance of mental well-being and offers counseling services that address issues such as depression, anxiety, and trauma related to abuse. By providing professional mental health services, the centre helps de-stigmatize mental health issues and encourages women to seek help, fostering a culture of openness and support. The project includes vocational training programs aimed at equipping women with skills that enhance their employability and economic independence. By learning trades such as tailoring, handicrafts, and computer skills, women can generate their own income, thus reducing their dependence on abusive partners and family members. Economic empowerment is crucial for fostering self-reliance and improving the overall quality of life for women and their families.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 42 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
